<title>UK: Sweden sets C$100 million December 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets C$100 million December 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     6.875     MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.40    PAY DATE  L-30.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.80     SPREAD	+21 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
